    {
      "number": 1418,
      "text": "If every wrongdoer were to possess all that is on earth, he would surely offer it to ransom himself. They will hide their remorse[46] when they see the punishment. They will be judged in all fairness, and they will not be wronged.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
