      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1419,
      "text": "Indeed, to Allah belongs all that is in the heavens and earth. Allah’s promise is certainly true, but most of them do not know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 215,
      "ruku": 177,
      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1420,
      "text": "It is He Who gives life and causes death, and to Him you will all be returned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 215,
      "ruku": 177,
      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1421,
      "text": "O people, there has come to you an exhortation from your Lord, a cure for [illness] of the hearts, a guidance and mercy for the believers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 215,
      "ruku": 177,
      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1422,
      "text": "Say, “By Allah’s grace and His mercy let them therefore rejoice. It is much better than what they accumulate[47].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 215,
      "ruku": 177,
      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1423,
      "text": "Say [to the pagans], “What do you think about the provision that Allah has sent down to you, of which you made some unlawful and some lawful[48].” Say, “Has Allah given you permission or are you fabricating lies against Allah?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 215,
      "ruku": 177,
      "hizbQuarter": 86,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1424,
      "text": "What do those who fabricate lies against Allah think of it on the Day of Judgment[49]? Indeed, Allah is bountiful to people, yet most of them are ungrateful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 10,
        "name": "سُورَةُ يُونُسَ",
        "englishName": "Yunus",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Jonas",
        "numberOfAyahs": 109,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 60,
      "juz": 11,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 215,
